00:00:33.623 --> 00:00:35.037
successes on Piper

00:00:35.558 --> 00:00:36.536
The release follows

00:00:36.348 --> 00:00:37.256
a preview that

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:38.741
scored 10.0 on

00:00:38.553 --> 00:00:39.732
the same benchmark

00:00:39.921 --> 00:00:40.746
after rounds of

00:00:40.558 --> 00:00:41.973
